  "content": "\n\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TeJCIjl.png\" alt=\"Formations Nether 横幅\" width=\"1903\" height=\"797\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Formations Nether</strong>&nbsp;为下界添加了大量新结构！</h3>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5g5Tv1t.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h4><strong>结构</strong></h4>\n<h5>以下是你在 Formations Nether 中可以找到的部分结构示例。如需更多图片，请查看图片画廊。</h5>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/728/310/172/small_fire_arena.png\" alt=\"充满凋灵敌人的致命竞技场\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/729/310/172/nether_wart_field.png\" alt=\"下界疣田\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/739/310/172/blackstone_remnant.png\" alt=\"黑石结构遗迹\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/731/310/172/large_house.png\" alt=\"隐藏在绯红森林中的房屋\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/eBJO3ce.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h4><strong>常见问题</strong></h4>\n<h5><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用你的模组吗？</strong></h5>\n<h5>是的，欢迎在您的整合包中使用我的模组</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PXuubVS.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>Discord</strong></h4>\n<h5>为了获取未来内容、即将推出的模组以及参与讨论，欢迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 服务器！</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"Discord 加入按钮\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PaZVj5S.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/L7py1j1.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DAvtJUL.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>",
